{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>羅志祥（小豬）《2026羅志祥30th巡迴演唱會香港站》今晚（13日）假紅館舉行，一登場即勁歌熱舞，連唱《Show’s Ｗorld》、《全城熱愛》、《舞魂再現》等快歌，炒熱全場氣氛。身為小豬忠粉的姜濤，小時候就因為偶像專登為自己改英文名叫「Show」，而2023年姜濤開騷就曾邀請小豬擔任嘉賓，今次輪到小豬在港開騷，亦順理成章請姜濤做嘉賓。</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142598910485729280032647.jpeg/4xKpchMoMEbMLWsO1xRajeYft0FfnljEnObQ7pzm0O4\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142598913170214912027431.jpeg/k4jM3822ht1JYVL-YEx2mwM669pd3fDCh_Zs7Yf2bO0\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599253248446464123607.jpeg/-oSmDXLXhSKEQiFK6BUQLE81NoEtdP-bpkxCSaZMQkk\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599256058761216509123.jpeg/hU9lT20XlGvGiAOZ4h23I4BeJ1dt02d8BZJSTgWSUk4\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599258957156352496305.jpeg/lR3TZ6vxxKuK8HnZBLUu9A7CNp80y_szNdYasTXWGrE\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599261515812864218075.jpeg/LpQKGBI1Wpv5agmYU0RaVzLbUnrIiFxJo3NIZ6NzSGc\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>姜濤出場方式非常有心思，小豬先在台下彈上台，一開始扮站不穩在地上打滾，之後再彈出來就變了姜濤。姜濤配合小豬同穿皮褸，全黑造型帥氣十足，他獻唱國語歌《撐腰》《白果》，唱完歌二人攬實準備落台之際，小豬突襲式錫了姜濤小嘴一啖，姜濤即尷尬笑用手掩住小嘴，小豬亦扮姜濤齊掩嘴，非常搞笑，掀起高潮，令歌迷瘋狂尖叫！</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599453505490944314258.jpeg/9lv6WHwh1l2wV1bhsBEzp6m-jd41sQvSeR2mCnkdpgo\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599031227158528943857.jpeg/hZPciEUr1CRrg-VJLoSDXOga2RvTjvJ9SVrcQkla3EI\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599033458659328863571.jpeg/i3yZL84wW-0PJ7iOSL4plYN4J0_TQoTK3F-xd9xfsXc\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599035719520256159238.jpeg/NWZqXYtZDDDf8P6G1lqNqIB9WsCOGlK1wtD-ocLQ_qE\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599363399258112352416.jpeg/nw4KybIOm-7K_KMz1nTQ2oaO-Mojn5htqvPq36rz6t8\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599365936943104016843.jpeg/HEEkKU60_ExLhTiV9Co9CuaruxdsP0z72LX66ti1-uo\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599368323633152165724.jpeg/XTLrA7dtstu_B7Q66lIJ3SowiE1-gdPppCHaIqQh2iI\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260613/1142599371058450432527096.jpeg/_wRGtN9OG0zkQQKUTA03y6pLvQpVpjXCkGHwKJBh8Cg\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-13T14:58:14.061961+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}